          "workspace"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finish",
      "name": "Finish",
      "description": "All deterministic and reviewer criteria passed.",
      "prompt": "The independent review passed. Read `reviews/executive-level-review-evaluation.md` with `read_artifact`, then use `write_task_note` to record a concise DONE summary with the final deliverable paths (`reviews/executive-level-review.md`, `reviews/executive-evidence.md`, `reviews/executive-options.md`) and the evidence that each acceptance criterion passed. Report DONE without starting new work.",
