      "prompt": "The deliverable did not pass after 3 review rounds. Do not claim success. Read `reviews/executive-level-review-evaluation.md` with `read_artifact`, then use `write_task_note` to record DONE_WITH_CONCERNS: the unmet criteria, what was attempted, the affected paths, and the smallest user decision or missing input needed to continue.",
      "suggestedRole": "project lead",
